    "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Hack. Build. Innovate. Solve real-world problems.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Maya Devi University presents <span class=\"s1\"><strong>Algonex 1.0</strong></span>, an exciting hackathon where you turn ideas into working solutions.</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Whether you are a seasoned developer, a UI/UX enthusiast, an AI explorer, a problem solver, or someone with a great idea, this is the opportunity to <span class=\"s1\"><strong>build something meaningful, collaborate with like-minded innovators, and showcase your skills.</strong></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><strong>What is Algonex 1.0?</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p2\">Algonex is a hands-on innovation challenge designed to encourage students to identify real-world problems and develop creative, technology-driven solutions.</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Participants will work in teams to ideate, design, develop, and present their solutions to a panel of judges.</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">From <span class=\"s1\"><strong>AI and Web Development to Blockchain, IoT, Cybersecurity, Mobile Applications, and emerging technologies</strong></span>, participants are encouraged to think beyond conventional solutions and build something impactful.</p>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Why Participate?</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Build a real project</strong></span> from idea to implementation</li>\n<li>Put your <span class=\"s1\"><strong>coding, design, problem-solving and innovation skills</strong></span> to the test</li>\n<li>Work with teammates from diverse technical backgrounds</li>\n<li>Get an opportunity to <span class=\"s1\"><strong>showcase your project to industry/academic experts</strong></span></li>\n<li>Compete with talented students and innovators</li>\n<li><span class=\"s1\">Earn </span><span class=\"s2\"><strong>certificates, recognition and exciting prizes</strong></span></li>\n<li>Add a meaningful project to your <span class=\"s1\"><strong>resume and portfolio</strong></span></li>\n<li>Meet fellow developers, creators and future entrepreneurs</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Who Can Participate?</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p2\">The hackathon is open to <span class=\"s1\"><strong>students from all disciplines and departments</strong></span>.</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">You don&rsquo;t need to be an expert programmer. If you have an idea, a willingness to learn, and the drive to build, <span class=\"s1\"><strong>you belong here.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Students interested in <span class=\"s1\"><strong>AI/ML, Web &amp; App Development, Cybersecurity, Blockchain, IoT, Cloud, UI/UX, Data Science</strong></span> and other technology domains are encouraged to participate.</p>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><strong>The Challenge</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Identify. Ideate. Build. Pitch.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Participants will be given the opportunity to work on meaningful problem statements and develop innovative solutions using technology.</p>\n<p class=\"p2\">The focus isn&rsquo;t just on writing code, <span class=\"s1\"><strong>it&rsquo;s about solving problems.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Think differently. Build boldly. Create something that matters.</p>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Event Highlights</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Ideation &rarr; Development &rarr; Testing &rarr; Presentation &rarr; Evaluation</strong></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">Participants will get a limited amount of time to transform their ideas into functional prototypes and pitch their solutions to the judging panel.</p>\n<p class=\"p4\">Projects will be evaluated on factors such as:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation &amp; Originality</li>\n<li>Problem Relevance</li>\n<li>Technical Implementation</li>\n<li>Creativity &amp; Design</li>\n<li>Feasibility &amp; Scalability</li>\n<li>Impact</li>\n<li>Presentation &amp; Pitch</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Ready to test your skills?</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"p1\">Bring your <span class=\"s1\"><strong>ideas, laptop, skills, creativity </strong>and <strong>a lot of enthusiasm</strong></span><span class=\"s2\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\">The mountains may be high, but the possibilities are higher.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Build something. Break boundaries.<br /></strong></p>",
    "end_date": "2026-11-28T18:00:00+05:30",
